# Round 18, C1-27 (follows): unit "may name only a rule label" (L §2.2); labels may be keywords (L §2.3 LABEL).
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
index ks = [a, b]
input v[k in ks]: int
def t: int
  rule unit = sum(v[k] for k in ks)
version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  v[*] = 1
ask q: t
=== expect
q: 2
  cut 2026-12-31
